(13012, 70, 106, 2327, 3, '2026-03-17 15:00:00', '2026-03-17 16:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 60, 42, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'We have reviewed the present perfect in the 30 min of the lesson. \nI have sent an email from the school email account with the class notes and homework. She needs to review the present perfect form and its use, as it is still not clear.', 'https://learnenglishkids.britishcouncil.org/sites/kids/files/attachment/grammar-practice-present-perfect-experiences-worksheet.pdf\n\nAnd study 10 verbs in the present, past, and past participle.\nPresent (Infinito)	Past Simple (Ieri)	Past Participle (Fatto)	Traduzione\nGo	Went	Gone	Andare\nDo	Did	Done	Fare\nHave	Had	Had	Avere\nSee	Saw	Seen	Vedere\nEat	Ate	Eaten	Mangiare\nDrink	Drank	Drunk	Bere\nBuy	Bought	Bought	Comprare\nGet	Got	Got / Gotten	Prendere / Ottenere\nTake	Took	Taken	Prendere / Portare\nMake	Made	Made	Fare / Creare\n\n\n', '2026-03-17 16:49:03', 13, 1, 0, 'Inglese', '2026-03-11 09:38:59', '2026-03-17 16:49:03'),
