(13014, 70, 106, 2327, 3, '2026-03-24 15:00:00', '2026-03-24 16:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, 60, 44, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'In class: Explanation of verb Should. Affirmative, negative and Interrogative form. Lazar understood well the topic but reinforcement might be needed. I explained the grammar in italian, making sure after every part that she understood. She made an effort although she doesn\'t have the level. She made several mistakes with basic pronouns all along the class, she didn\'t remember the diff between he/we/they...', 'I have sent a doc with the notes from class and an exercise at the end to point mistakes in sentences with should after doing a very similar exercise in the class. ', '2026-04-07 11:17:46', 13, 1, 0, 'Inglese', '2026-03-11 09:38:59', '2026-04-07 11:17:46'),
